BIT-06: React a pipe's identical segments once

Every pipe starts as 100 identical segments, and many stay identical:
same water, same pipe, same reactions. Each was integrated on its own every
step. Integrate a run of segments with equal concentrations once and copy
the result to the others.

Requires: none
Results: identical (every concentration, the output file and the report are unchanged)

Apply from the root of an EPANET-MSX checkout at 85a303d, after FIX-01, FIX-02 and BIT-01 to BIT-05:
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn BIT-06.patch
or use tools/build-msx.sh, which applies the series in order.

